{"word":"ἅπας","uri":"hapas","senses":[{"word":"ἅπας","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἅπας,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">-ασα, -αν,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">gén.</span> <span class=\"gens\">ἅπαντος, άσης,\n-αντος</span> [<span class=\"grec\">ᾰπᾱς,</span> <span class=\"ital\">neutre</span> <span class=\"grec\">ᾰπᾱν,</span> <span class=\"ital\">mais</span> <span class=\"grec\">ᾰπᾰν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hom.</span> <span class=\"ital\">v. ci-dessous</span>]\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\nsg.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> tout à la fois, tout\nentier : <span class=\"grec\">ἐγκέφαλος δὲ ἔνδον ἅπας\nπεπάλακτο,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 98,</span> et à l’intérieur, la cervelle tout entière\nétait broyée ; <span class=\"grec\">ἅπας λεώς,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Tr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">194,</span> tout le peuple ; <span class=\"grec\">εἰς ἅπαντα\nχρόνον,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eum.</span> <span class=\"refch\">484,</span> pour\nl’éternité ; <span class=\"ital\">avec un nom abstrait :</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἅπασ’ ἀνάγκη,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">171,</span> il y a toute nécessité, nécessité absolue ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec l’inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Ran.</span> <span class=\"refch\">373 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἅπας κίνδυνος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">N.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 21 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Nub.</span> <span class=\"refch\">955,</span> il y a\nabsolument danger ; <span class=\"ital\">avec un adj.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀργύρεος ἅπας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 616,</span> tout en argent,\nd’argent m